WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:35.920
"The Day When the Long Night Ends"

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.840
Go back home!

00:01:40.010 --> 00:01:41.050
Eugene!

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:45.640
Why are you here?  Only family members are allowed in this mansion on this day!

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:47.020
Master Eugene...

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:51.760
Prepare the car to drop her back off in the city!

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:55.380
I'm not going anywhere!

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.370
If you really want me out, you're gonna have to force me out!

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:03.430
What is all of this ruckus?

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:06.870
Hmm?!?

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.150
Hi, Eugene's second brother!

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:11.490
Miss Ka...Kajika!?

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:16.730
I came from New York just to visit Eugene, and he is already trying to get rid of me.

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:18.010
Wha....what!?

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:23.730
Orbach! Please escort her to the best room in the mansion!

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:24.850
Yes sir.

00:02:25.010 --> 00:02:26.920
But Xavier, today is....

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:27.880
Quiet!

00:02:31.990 --> 00:02:35.160
Miss Kajika, you should join us for dinner later...

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.360
What a beautiful lady.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:42.050
This is Eugene's grandmother.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:47.740
Eugene resembles our grandmother and my brother, and I look more like our grandfather and father.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.650
Alrighty now... let's go.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:57.020
It all started from our father's complex about his appearance.

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.000
I don't understand...

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.630
It's not like he needs to wear a bag over his head.

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:11.050
His face shows all the things he's been through.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.810
That's exactly right.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:14.780
Huh?

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:20.250
People's facial features develop to match their true beauty.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:24.680
You can try to cheat nature, but you'll only get so far.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:28.880
Wow, I don't remember you ever speaking so much.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:32.380
I always knew my place.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:37.820
Just like I've known since I was born what fate I deserved.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.000
What a pretty garden.

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.510
I already told you to leave, Kajika.

00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:53.730
I don't want to leave. I like you, Eugene.

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.510
Don't say that so lightly.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:58.360
I mean it!

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.230
Eugene, do you know about the spirit of words?

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:10.190
On Givoli they believe, like Japan, that spirits are everywhere.

00:04:10.410 --> 00:04:12.590
They're even in our words.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:19.330
Maria often warned me that evil words have evil spirits...

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:24.050
and a word once spoken can never be taken back.

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:29.620
So, I don't ever say anything I don't mean.  When I say I like you, I mean it.

00:04:33.510 --> 00:04:38.260
Lee-Leng told me to go figure out what type of "like" I feel for you.

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:45.850
Lee-Leng? I can't believe he approved of your liking me. But, I don't care what he thinks. I still won't accept your feelings.

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:47.720
Why?

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:56.350
Kajika, I always loved listening to your voice and the stories you told me.

00:04:56.890 --> 00:05:02.180
Your words are what keep me going.

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.760
Don't come down for dinner. I'll deliver your food to you.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:13.900
Eugene!

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:17.610
Please listen to me.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:20.800
Ok...

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:22.880
Thanks.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.480
Something is wrong with Eugene...

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.110
You're ok with that?

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.700
Uhh, yes?

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:43.370
May I sit and talk with you for a moment?

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:49.660
What is going on tonight? They're not just having a birthday party, are they?

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:56.870
That's what I came here to ask for... I need you to keep your eyes on Eugene tonight.

00:05:58.110 --> 00:06:03.910
For as long as I can remember, Eugene has been obsessed with his 20th birthday party.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:05.760
Why?

00:06:06.490 --> 00:06:19.190
Kristin... oh... Eugene's mother committed suicide the day of her 20th birthday. She jumped out of a window on the 3rd floor.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:33.530
It all started with Eugene's grandmother's extreme obsession over her youngest son, Alan.

00:06:37.550 --> 00:06:39.070
She looks just like Eugene.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:45.400
She was forced into marriage by her father, for his convenience.

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:51.980
She hated her husband. She also disliked Eugene's father, her first son, since he resembled him so much.

00:06:54.100 --> 00:06:56.030
Father... it's time.

00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:06.710
Eugene, you've become so handsome...  even more handsome than Alan.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:10.190
Are you referring to the late Uncle Alan?

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:24.320
My little brother was known for the careless use of his money. He would constantly ask me for more money to borrow...

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:29.190
Even until the day of his accident.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.700
Mother keeps nagging me to conceive a child.

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:40.430
She tells me that she doesn't really care for a child conceived by you.

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:44.650
Take this and get the hell out of here!

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:53.080
Oh by the way, rumor says that you're planning to get remarried to your secretary...

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:57.740
My advice... don't do it. She's a whore.

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:04.880
She basically revealed to me her true intentions.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:12.170
I assure you... she's a whore.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.040
I'm gonna kill him...

00:08:16.270 --> 00:08:17.390
What's the matter?

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:28.660
Hm? Oh nothing. You're a good kid, my prideful son.

00:08:38.930 --> 00:08:42.690
Father, you'll have to meet Kajika!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:46.390
I think Eugene could do some good for the family.

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:48.400
I'm against it.

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:54.800
Pierre, imagine if we could merge families with the Burnsworths.... us Volkans could...

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.270
Do you see Eugene being a good father?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:09:00.310
There's no way the Burnsworths would like him.

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:05.440
That's enough! We're here to celebrate Eugene's birthday today!

00:09:05.790 --> 00:09:16.380
Don't worry about anything, Pierre. I'm neither planning on marrying Kajika, nor merging business ties with the Burnsworths.

00:09:19.140 --> 00:09:28.050
I'm never going to be 20, I'm always going to remain 19, just like my mother, Kristin.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:44.570
Orbach, why are you telling me this?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:51.210
I can sense that Eugene likes you.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:52.940
GO HOME!

00:09:53.130 --> 00:10:02.600
I've never seen him like that in my life. I know you can save him. Please help him.

00:10:05.380 --> 00:10:12.050
Pierre, did you know that my real father was Uncle Alan?

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:19.800
You fool! He passed away over 10 years before you came along!

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:28.090
Although he was in a coma, his organs worked perfectly well until the day he died.

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:31.040
Right, father?

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:41.050
Alan? How did this ever happen to you? My future ....my dream is over!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:45.880
Madam, please control yourself. You still have your other son, Auguste.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:52.810
My only precious Alan. Auguste isn't fit to bear my grandson!!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:11:03.120
From that moment, something sparked inside of me. I couldn't stop thinking about what I was going to do.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:08.270
I realized from that point on that I was going to take revenge against Alan.

00:11:10.280 --> 00:11:19.950
I was going to use him and create a far better creation than him!

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:30.540
For 15 years, Alan's sperm was frozen and kept preserved until a woman was found to bear the child.

00:11:31.780 --> 00:11:34.230
How did you find that out?

00:11:35.420 --> 00:11:50.130
When I was 9, I found out when I was playing in her room. I discovered her diary, which mentioned every detail about the incident.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:12:00.070
"Help me! I'm bearing a demon child! I'm scared! I'm going to be killed!"

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:05.430
I asked around and found people who were working at that time to find out more.

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:08.020
Eugene...

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:15.660
You took 15 years to find the perfect wife...

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:27.050
Kristin, and forced a marriage upon her at 18 years of age.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:32.270
Kristin was a lovely lady.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:45.220
She lived constantly in fear.  The marriage, the unborn child, the unknown father of the child....

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:51.970
Help me.. I'm scared... I'm gonna be killed!

00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:55.680
Those 10 months were grueling for her.

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.130
Noooo!!!

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:06.570
I still get chills when I think about that day, hearing those shrill cries when she gave birth.

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:17.990
You made her give birth to me out of revenge!

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.550
Eugene!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:27.650
We both assisted in killing an innocent person.

00:13:29.650 --> 00:13:42.140
I am going to end my life the same age my mother ended hers.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:46.310
I'm sorry father, my life ends here...

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:55.940
Father, I keep hearing her shrill cries....

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:03.140
I caused my mother to suffer and die...

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.140
Help me!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:16.400
All I hear constantly in my mind are her cries of fear.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:26.830
Father, please save me... please save me from this suffering. Father....

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.080
Eu...gene.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:32.080
Father...

00:14:34.820 --> 00:14:49.440
Forgive me...  please forgive me. Forgive me, Eugene. Forgive me, Alan. Forgive me, Kristin.

00:14:51.730 --> 00:15:00.430
I really loved her.... I loved all of you!!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.400
I loved you, father.

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:12.850
EUGENE!!!!

00:15:15.790 --> 00:15:16.990
Miss Kajika!

00:15:20.280 --> 00:15:21.860
He went upstairs!

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:26.200
I know he went up to the 3rd floor. The same floor his mother jumped from. Keep everyone back!

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:27.970
Got it!

00:15:31.480 --> 00:15:33.200
That's...me...

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:42.940
She died before getting to see her 20th birthday... Mother, I'm going to go with you....

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:44.900
Eugene!

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.520
Eugene!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:57.110
Y...you!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:00.210
I won't forgive you for doing this!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:05.480
Quiet. Stay back. I won't let you get in her way.

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:10.740
Eugene...

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:21.210
I just killed the part of you that wanted to die, so you, yourself, no longer have to die.

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.280
You don't have to suffer anymore....

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:33.290
Come here, Mustafa....

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:52.260
Eugene...

00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:57.790
Happy Birthday....

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:18.740
Master Eugene.

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:25.100
I got worried since I didn't see you in your room.

00:17:25.710 --> 00:17:26.980
Kajika was there though, correct?

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:32.420
She stayed by my side all night and fell asleep.

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:39.700
What a gentle expression. He's like a completely different person.

00:17:40.670 --> 00:17:49.070
Until last night, I didn't know a bed was something used for rest.  If only I had known earlier.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:51.350
Eugene...

00:17:52.950 --> 00:17:59.080
By the way, did you know that this garden was made for your mother?

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:03.730
Your father had it made to look like her garden from her old home, although she never got to see it.

00:18:06.130 --> 00:18:10.560
What were you thinking?! How could you have slept in a bed with another guy!!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:15.890
I know... but hear this! Last night, I became aware that... Eugene was, in fact, Mustafa!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:22.800
I... keep telling you time and time again that the reincarnation stuff is just a myth!

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:25.450
But that's what I believe in...

00:18:26.990 --> 00:18:29.170
You can't be in the same bed and sleep with him...

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:30.630
Why, do you have a problem?

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.420
Of course!!

00:18:34.360 --> 00:18:39.640
Eugene's father is calling for you. You better hurry and go!

00:18:44.230 --> 00:18:52.660
Thank you, Kajika. You saved Eugene's life. I don't know what I would've done without your help.

00:18:56.050 --> 00:18:59.040
I loved Kristin.

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:12.000
She resembled my mother so much. I soon came to forget about my initial intentions for her.

00:19:13.020 --> 00:19:16.620
I just wanted her by my side.

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:24.100
But she was fearful of me....

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:28.620
I didn't understand...

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.770
My hatred towards her slowly grew as much as my love

00:19:33.700 --> 00:19:38.850
I made that innocent woman suffer because of me.

00:19:39.480 --> 00:19:44.990
I had a revengeful heart.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:50.120
Eugene probably despised me as well.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.780
Eugene never hated you.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:10.640
Eugene was trying to find someone to kill him and take away his pain, but no one could kill him.

00:20:11.400 --> 00:20:20.920
He's so beautiful. No one would kill such a beautiful soul. Who could do such a thing?

00:20:21.370 --> 00:20:36.160
He was trying to find a way to die, but he never wanted you to be responsible for his death or cause you trouble.

00:20:36.860 --> 00:20:44.720
He loved you. He had already forgiven you a long time ago.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:54.580
What is this? This girl is very much like an angel.

00:20:56.510 --> 00:20:59.510
Lee-Leng! I knew you would come!

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:02.370
Did you finish your job?

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:05.420
Who did you hear from? How are things by the way?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:07.900
I'm OK.

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:12.150
Did you figure out if you truly love Eugene or not, and whether you want him as your husband?

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:15.770
Yup. I love him.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:23.480
And oh, I realized that Eugene was in fact Mustafa, so how could I not love him?

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:32.250
Kajika, put the Mustafa thing aside.  The important question is... do you want Eugene as your husband?

00:21:32.720 --> 00:21:35.280
That part...I'm not so sure of myself.

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:38.270
Although, I did sleep in the same bed as Eugene....

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:42.950
I fell asleep so peacefully.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:47.200
If you truly love someone, aren't you supposed to have butterflies in your stomach?

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:48.660
I... guess.

00:21:49.450 --> 00:21:52.690
We'll all sit down together and talk.

00:21:53.400 --> 00:21:58.120
Well, I guess she hasn't fully committed to deciding on Eugene. That's good.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:21:59.830
Welcome.

00:22:01.310 --> 00:22:02.270
Mustafa!

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:11.420
He looks completely like a new person... what happened to his coldness?

00:22:17.370 --> 00:22:19.060
You seem quite disturbed.

00:22:19.370 --> 00:22:21.100
I just don't care to see that.

00:22:21.710 --> 00:22:28.700
Please don't do that when you're out in the public eye. You guys already stand out like a sore thumb.

00:22:29.380 --> 00:22:36.960
We'll see about that.

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:39.440
You...

00:22:45.860 --> 00:22:48.650
He used to do that when he didn't like someone.

00:22:51.130 --> 00:22:53.430
Mustafa used to do that.

00:22:55.270 --> 00:22:56.460
What's wrong Lee-Leng?

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:00.040
It can't be...

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
